Z||000003||FieroJoe||02-05-2001||09:59 PM||||OK <I>DAD</I>!  I'll do it after I clean my room!<BR>I am hoping by April, no later than May (needs to be 60 degrees to repaint)<P>All the vinyl needed to be redone, and it has, I am adding power locks and mirrors (waiting on parts), new dewstrips, new driver's side glass, adding factory sub system, new keyless/alarm system, some neat little electrical gadgets that are top secret...<P>Carpet needed to be cleaned like no other, and I was just curious at how much rust there might have been on the floor pans.  So i took that out too!<P>After I finish all my electrical stuff, repair the front energy absorber (fasteners were broken when a deer hit it, fascia is just fine) and put the rest of the body back together, my dad and I are going to repaint the whole car (we paint cars as a "hobby").<P>Then after that, put the interior back together...<P>AND DRIVE IT!!!!!! I will be so happy!!||||reg||1
